{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03339","headline":"奉和幸大荐福寺 · 宋之问","name":"奉和幸大荐福寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香刹中天起，宸游满路辉。\n乘龙太子去，驾象法王归。\n殿饰金人影，窗摇玉女扉。\n稍迷新草木，徧识旧庭闱。\n水入禅心定，云从宝思飞。\n欲知皇劫远，初拂六铢衣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"宋之问","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}